# Lets GitHub render a "Cite this repository" button and feeds Zenodo at release.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "FinTree — a canonical US GAAP profit-and-loss ontology"
abstract: >-
  A canonical US GAAP profit-and-loss ontology of 234 XBRL-mapped nodes with
  variance drivers, comparability examples, and chart-of-accounts mappings,
  designed for FP&A teams and AI agents to reason over financial statements.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-02"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/gtm-k/fintree"
authors:
  - family-names: "Kethineedi"
    given-names: "Gowtham"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4175-203X"
keywords:
  - US GAAP
  - financial ontology
  - XBRL
  - FP&A
  - profit and loss
  - chart of accounts
  - financial data model
